{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12979","headline":"得李滁州书以玉潭庄见托因书春思以诗代荅 · 独孤及","name":"得李滁州书以玉潭庄见托因书春思以诗代荅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春物行将老，怀君意讵堪。\n朱颜因酒强，白发对花慙。\n日日思琼树，书书话玉潭。\n知同百口累，曷日办抽簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}